steps.description:
Welcome!  This guided tour introduces every Solidity file living in `src/interfaces` and sketches the **"surface‐area"** that **Alchemix V3** exposes to—or consumes from—other contracts.  You will:
- see the full directory listing;
- sort the interfaces into three conceptual buckets;
- glance at each interface’s public API (`function`/`event` signatures only, no deep dives yet);
- finish with a recap of how these definitions mark the boundary between **Alchemix** and the outside world.
